                      "content": [
                        {
                          "type": "text",
                          "text": "The Ministry of Health's Drug Advisory Committee has not recommended listing insulin glargine 300 units/ml on the Standard Drug List (SDL) for treating type 1 and 2 diabetes mellitus in view of unfavourable cost-effectiveness compared with insulin glargine 100 units/ml at the price proposed by the manufacturer, and low clinical need."
                        }
                      ]
                    }
                  ]
                }
              ]
